{"schema_version":"1.0","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extraordinary/","title":"기경팔맥 탐색 허브","language":"ko-KR","description":"초창기 침구 분류에서 기경팔맥 최신 기준문서로 연결하는 탐색 허브입니다.","text":"기경팔맥 탐색 허브\n기경팔맥의 기준문서는 현재 경락·경맥 임상 지식망으로 통합되어 있습니다.\n여덟 기경\n임맥\n독맥\n충맥\n대맥\n음교맥\n양교맥\n음유맥\n양유맥\n→ 기경팔맥 통합 지도\n→ 팔맥교회혈","headings":[{"level":2,"title":"여덟 기경","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extraordinary/#_2"}],"links":["https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/meridian-network/chong-vessel/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/meridian-network/conception-vessel/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/meridian-network/dai-vessel/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/meridian-network/extraordinary-vessels/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/meridian-network/governing-vessel/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/meridian-network/special-points/eight-confluent/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/meridian-network/yang-qiao-vessel/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/meridian-network/yang-wei-vessel/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/meridian-network/yin-qiao-vessel/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/meridian-network/yin-wei-vessel/"],"related_reading":[],"interpretation":"Public article text and navigation only; links do not establish clinical equivalence or treatment recommendations."}
